V:
Yor mham Yê-su gâp klaih ngăn jêh, Păng tâm chuai gâp ta si tâm rkăng.
Gâp mâu hôm ƀư brah lah yang ôh, mâu hôm kuăl brah mhĭk kơt sa-ơm.
V:
Lah geh ngo klĕng gâp mâu klach ôh, yor lah Yê-su gŭ dăch gâp jêh.
Geh dak lip kđôi, ăt gâp gŭ ueh, Yê-su ăn gâp gŭ ktang ƀa-ƀơ.
V:
Lah geh bu mưch, tâm rmot dŭt n'hâm, gâp gŭ klăk klêm, mâu geh mphar ôh.
Yê-su mprơh ngai lĕ rngôch Brah Mhĭk, Păng sâm king gâp gŭ đăp rmên ngăn.
V:
Gâp ƀư ngih jêh ta klơ lŭ klêr, mâu ŭch ƀư ôh tâm ntŭk neh choih.
Gâp jăt Yê-su mâu tĭng Brah Mhĭk, Yê-su lŭ klêr, Brah Mhĭk neh choih.
C:
Ta klơ Yê-su nâm bu lŭ klêr, lĕ rngôch ntŭk êng nâm bu neh choih,
lĕ rngôch ntŭk êng nâm bu neh choih.
A:
N: Page-84 is an identical second copy of this song (printed page -84-); the score uses page-83 only. Check whether a song is missing at page-84.

